export const sourceCode = "# Introduction\n\nWelcome to the official Boxicons documentation. This guide will help you understand what Boxicons is, what’s included in each plan, and how to get the most out of the icon library in your design and development workflows.\n\n## What is Boxicons?\n\nBoxicons is a high-quality, modern icon library built to elevate your UI and product design.\n\nBoxicons currently offers **5 icon packs**:\n\n- Basic\n- Filled\n- Duotone\n- Duotone Solid\n- Duotone Mix\n\nEach pack includes:\n\n- **3 styles:** Regular, Rounded, Sharp\n- **3 weights:** Normal, Thin, Bold\n\nThis results in **50,000+ icon variations** across all packs, giving you complete flexibility to match any design system or product aesthetic.\n\nAll icons are optimized for clarity, consistency, and performance across web and app interfaces.\n\n## What do I get with Boxicons Pro?\n\n> The free version is great for testing and lightweight usage. Boxicons Pro unlocks the full library and all tools.\n\n### Free version includes\n\n- Basic — Regular — Normal\n- Filled — Regular — Normal\n\n### Boxicons Pro includes\n\nAll remaining variations:\n\n- **All weights:** Thin (200), Normal (400), Bold (700)\n- **All styles:** Regular, Rounded, Sharp\n- **All packs:** Basic, Filled, Duotone, Duotone Mix, Duotone Solid\n\nPlus premium tools and features:\n\n- **Continuous Updates:** Access to year-long updates, including new icons and duotone releases.\n- **Design Tools:** Seamless workflows with dedicated **Figma** and **Framer** plugins.\n- **Framework Packages:** Native, tree-shakable components for **React**, **Vue**, and **Svelte**.\n- **JavaScript Library:** Flexible SVG generation and auto-replacement for any JS environment.\n- **Icon Explorer:** Browse, customize, and export icons in multiple formats instantly.\n- **Team Management:** Collaborative plans for Teams (up to 8 users) and Enterprises (up to 40 users).\n\n## What’s Coming Next?\n\n> Boxicons is actively evolving.\n\nWe are continuously working on:\n\n- New icon packs\n- New duotone variations\n- New platform integrations\n- Workflow and performance improvements\n\nYou can stay updated on upcoming features and releases on : \n\n**Changelog** page [here](https://boxicons.com/changelog) and **Roadmap** page [here](https://boxicons.com/roadmap).\n\nMore tools and packages are already planned and will be released over time.\n\n## Need Support?\n\n> If you need help, we’re here for you.\n\nContact us at:\n\n**[contact@boxicons.com](mailto:contact@boxicons.com)**\n\nWe aim to respond to all support requests within **24 hours**.";
